      "sha256": "0e9dd05f5d63c6c0eedd1808045b09157f71c1c735de706614938e562f535703",
      "summary": "If lamps appear without atmosphere, describe receiving surfaces, fill and reflections. Separate facial illumination from the background cast when both matter.",
      "questions": [
        "Why are lamps and glows present without the intended atmosphere?"
